        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-CSD2008HMRSBR, Hammered Brass Cascade Pull Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered Brass Cascade Pull comes packaged with 2 half circles made to be mounted on one side of a pair of double doors. It can be surface mounted or thru-bolt mounted. The Cascade Door Pull Set is made from hammered brass and is available in a huge selection of finishes. It is 8 inches long with 5 inch center to center mounting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PR-CSD2008HMRSBR Cascade Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CSD03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262332\"><b>First Impressions PR-CSD2008HMRSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 door pull handles).</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Cascade Door Pull Set",
                "description": "The Hammered Brass Cascade Pull comes packaged with 2 half circles made to be mounted on one side of a pair of double doors. It can be surface mounted or thru-bolt mounted. The Cascade Door Pull Set is made from hammered brass and is available in a huge selection of finishes. It is 8 inches long with 5 inch center to center mounting. \r\n",
